###Mapping
// The order-execution mapping.
//
// It INCLUDES both dependency mappings, which is what makes the sixteen cross-project
// association ends below resolvable: `orderFills[ordOrder, oexFill]` names a set id that
// belongs to order_core::Mapping, and a set id can only be named if the mapping that
// declared it is in scope.
//
// Every set id is stated explicitly and oex-prefixed. Two consequences:
//   * the DEFAULT ids (`order_execution_Fill` and friends) therefore do NOT exist, so a
//     downstream project extending one of these sets must name the oex id;
//   * every AssociationMapping end carries [sourceSetId, targetSetId], because the bare
//     `prop: [db]@Join` form resolves only against default ids -- and sixteen of the ends
//     here have a far side whose id was declared in another project entirely (`ordOrder`,
//     `ordExecution`, `ordVenue`, `tcTrade`, `tcAllocation`, `tcTradeCharge`, `tcVenue`).
//
// There are no EnumerationMappings here. This project has no enums: the code fields are
// Strings, because the vocabularies they carry (ExecType, liquidity flag, session type) are
// venue-defined and change without notice, and pinning them into an enum would make every
// new venue a model change.
Mapping order_execution::Mapping
(
   include order_core::Mapping
   include trade_capture::Mapping

   // ---------------------------------------------------------------- class sets
   //
   // The foreign-key columns appear in the joins and, where the model reaches the thing by
   // association, nowhere in these sets.

   *order_execution::Fill[oexFill]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.FILL_ID )
      ~mainTable [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL
      fillId: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.FILL_ID,
      venueFillRef: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.VENUE_FILL_REF,
      fillQuantity: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.FILL_QUANTITY,
      fillPrice: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.FILL_PRICE,
      grossValue: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.GROSS_VALUE,
      currency: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.CURRENCY,
      cumulativeQuantity: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.CUMULATIVE_QUANTITY,
      executedAt: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.EXECUTED_AT,
      reportedAt: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.REPORTED_AT,
      liquidityFlag: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.LIQUIDITY_FLAG,
      bustTime: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.BUST_TIME,
      executionVenueMic: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.EXECUTION_VENUE_MIC,
      settlementDate: [order_execution::Store]OEX_FILL.SETTLEMENT_DATE
   }

